  data: {
    LLM: "Choose when to play a card to the battle versus when to steal an opponent's pile; stealing a small pile may be less valuable than winning a war.\n\nTrack the top card of each capture pile so you know when you can steal. Prefer stealing when the opponent's pile is large; prefer playing to the battle when you can win the war or when your card is strong.\n\nWeigh the expected value of stealing a pile versus winning the current battle or war. Protect your own pile by playing a card that matches your pile top when the opponent could otherwise steal it.",
